    {
      "subject": "Porfiry",
      "relation": "SERVANT_OF",
      "object": "Father Zossima",
      "quote": "Do you hear this, Porfiry?” he turned to the novice who waited on him.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 39,
      "doc_id": "ch039",
      "label_ko": "6편 1장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Father Zossima",
      "relation": "LOVES",
      "object": "Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "quote": "Many times I’ve seen in your face as it were a look of mortification that I love Alexey more than you.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 39,
      "doc_id": "ch039",
      "label_ko": "6편 1장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Father Zossima",
      "relation": "LOVES",
      "object": "Porfiry",
      "quote": "Now you know why that was so, but I love you too, know that, and many times I grieved at your mortification.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 39,
      "doc_id": "ch039",
      "label_ko": "6편 1장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Father Zossima",
      "relation": "LIVES_AT",
      "object": "V.",
      "quote": "I was born in a distant province in the north, in the town of V.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 39,
      "doc_id": "ch039",
      "label_ko": "6편 1장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Father Zossima",
      "relation": "LIVES_AT",
      "object": "Kostroma",
      "quote": "when Father Zossima first began his life as a monk in a poor and little monastery at Kostroma",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 39,
      "doc_id": "ch039",
      "label_ko": "6편 1장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Markel",
      "relation": "BROTHER_OF",
      "object": "Father Zossima",
      "quote": "In the sixth week in Lent, my brother, who was never strong and had a tendency to consumption, was taken ill.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 39,
      "doc_id": "ch039",
      "label_ko": "6편 1장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Father Zossima",
      "relation": "POSSESSES",
      "object": "A Hundred and Four Stories from the Old and New Testament",
      "quote": "I had a book of Scripture history then with excellent pictures, called _A Hundred and Four Stories from the Old and New Testament_, and I learned to read from it.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 39,
      "doc_id": "ch039",
      "label_ko": "6편 1장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Father Zossima",
      "relation": "MEMBER_OF",
      "object": "Cadet Corps",
      "quote": "She brought me to Petersburg and put me into the Cadet Corps, and I never saw her again.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 39,
      "doc_id": "ch039",
      "label_ko": "6편 1장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Job",
      "relation": "LIVES_AT",
      "object": "Land of Uz",
      "quote": "In the land of Uz, there lived a man, righteous and God-fearing, and he had great wealth, so many camels, so many sheep and asses",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 39,
      "doc_id": "ch039",
      "label_ko": "6편 1장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Jacob",
      "relation": "FATHER_OF",
      "object": "Joseph",
      "quote": "how the brothers sold Joseph, the tender boy, the dreamer and prophet, into bondage, and told their father that a wild beast had devoured him",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 39,
      "doc_id": "ch039",
      "label_ko": "6편 1장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Jacob",
      "relation": "FATHER_OF",
      "object": "Judah",
      "quote": "that from his offspring, from Judah, will come the great hope of the world, the Messiah and Saviour.",
